<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
<div class="show-news01"><h5 times new roman";" style=" font-size: 30px;color:#333333;line-height:42px;margin-bottom:10px; text-align: center">School of Electronic Engineering</h5></div>
    <div id="vsb_content" style="margin-bottom: 40px;font-size: 18px;color: #333333;line-height:30px;text-align:justify;display: block;margin: 30px auto;max-width: 1080px; min-height:800px;"><div class="v_news_content">
<div class="Section0" style="vsb_temp: 15.6000pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">The School of Electronic Engineering of Xidian University has a long history with a strong academic strength in education operation. Founded in 1952, it is one of the earliest departments in China to set up majors including radar, microwave antenna and DZDK. After 70 years of development, it has formed its distinctive characteristics and advantages in electronics and information disciplines.</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">S</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">chool has three disciplines with master's and doctoral degrees programs (all these are national key disciplines categorized into seven doctoral specialties and eight master's specialties), and four undergraduate majors.</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Adhering to morality-first and student-oriented education with teachers being the core competitiveness, the </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">S</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">chool has forged a well-structured and innovative faculty group. At present, there are 374 faculty members, including 329 full-time faculty members, 146 full-time doctoral supervisors and 264 full-time master supervisors. The </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">s</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">chool has 4 national-level innovation teams and 2 Ministry-of-Education-level innovation teams.</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Adhering to the ideal of "competency-based and classified education", the </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">S</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">chool has actively explored and implemented a series of innovative talent cultivation mode reforms, such as the "Excellent Engineers Education and Training Program", "Bi Dexian Teaching Reform Class", and "Sino-French Cooperative Education Project". Over the past five years, our students have won more than 100 prizes in various national-level academic as well as science and technology competitions. Highly favored by employers, our graduate and undergraduate students have kept the employment rates above 99.4 % and 98% respectively.</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">S</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">chool has 6 national-level research platforms, 3 Ministry-of-Education-level research platforms, 3 Shaanxi Provincial-level research platforms, 3 national-level experiment teaching demonstration centers, and 2 Shaanxi Provincial-level experiment teaching demonstration centers. The </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">S</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">chool produced the first meteorological precipitation-monitoring radar after the founding of the People’s Republic of China in 1949, developed the first programmable radar signal processor and the first generation of large-scale phased array radar in China, made a number of landmark achievements in the fields of radar, antenna and microwave, information security, artificial intelligence, etc. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">During its 70 years of operation, the</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">&nbsp;S</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">chool has trained for the nation a large number of well-known scholars, senior managers, leading electronic information talents as well as more than 30,000 outstanding talents in related fields, making important contributions to national construction and social progress. In future, the</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;">&nbsp;S</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">chool will continue to stick to the path of intensive development. By giving full play to the advantages of specialized research fields and comprehensive academic strength, we will stand in the frontier of global science and technology development, meet the major needs of the nation, focus on the main battlefields in national economy, gather the first-class team to cultivate outstanding talents, make first-rate achievements and contributions, and make unremitting efforts to build a world-class school with distinctive characteristics in electronic information.</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Songti SC&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-shading: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 12pt; mso-spacerun: &quot;yes&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;">Homepage: <a href="https://ensee.xidian.edu.cn/" target="_blank"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px;">https://ensee.xidian.edu.cn/</span></a></span></p>
</div>
